# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Ji Qi et al. (2024). Robust training of machine learning interatomic potentials with dimensionality reduction and stratified sampling.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-024-01227-4  arXiv:2307.13710v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2307.13710v1 (sha256 b5da06ff1a5f5e0e...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 39 (Training/reliability). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: the DIRECT sampling strategy and the models trained to
# demonstrate it: the M3GNet universal potential refitted on the DIRECT
# set and on the manually sampled (MS) set of MPF.2021.2.8.All
# (M3GNet-DIRECT is the registry model that later papers evaluate), and
# two moment tensor potentials for Ti-H fitted on DIRECT-selected and on
# active-learning structures.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-qi2024 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Qi et al. (2024): robust MLIP training with dimensionality-reduced encoded clusters with stratified (DIRECT) sampling" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-qi2024 .

entity:article-qi2024 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41524-024-01227-4> ;
    schema:datePublished "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "Robust training of machine learning interatomic potentials with dimensionality reduction and stratified sampling" ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5808-9931> ,
