###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Per-test-set errors of M3GNet-DIRECT and M3GNet-MS (Figure 4) and the MTP-DIRECT / MTP-AL errors on 400 AIMD test structures (Figure 7; stated only as 'below 10 eV/atom [sic] and 0.15 eV/A') are given as figures or bounds; only the averaged M3GNet-DIRECT MAEs printed in the text are encoded.
# - Energy MAE is printed in eV/atom, for which the vocabulary has no unit; mlips:hasUnit is omitted (value not converted).
# - The doubling of the atom-embedding and MLP dimensions from 64 to 128 is encoded as mlips:numFeatures 128; other M3GNet settings are 'the same as the original M3GNet UP' and not restated.
# - M3GNet-DIRECT is the registry model entity:model-M3GNet-DIRECT; this file declares its registry run with data set and settings, and focassio2024 (encoded earlier) carries the stub of the same run.
# - The hypothetical O- and S-containing compound tests (energy above hull after relaxation) and the coverage scores of the sampling have no MetricProperty.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).

